;
;000,0,General / Decimal Values
;000,1,Engine Speed (G28),Specification (Idle): 32...36 (870...950 RPM)\nSpecification (Full Load): 118...148 (2500...3100 RPM)
;000,2,Start of Injection,Specification (Idle): 51...88 (0 °ATDC ... 5 °BTDC)\nSpecification (Full Load): 86...163 (1.5 °BTDC ... 10.0 °BTDC)
;000,3,Accel. Pedal Pos. Sensor 1 (G79),Range: 0...255 (0.0...100.0 %)\nSpecification (Idle): 0 (0.0 %)\nSpecification (Full Load): 255 (99.0...100.0 %)
;000,4,Injection Quantity,Specification (Idle): 10..30 (3.0...9.0 mg/Str.)\nSpecification (Full Load): 165...200 (33.0...40.0 mg/Str.)
;000,5,Intake Manifold Pressure,Specification (Idle): 82...102 (900.0...1100.0 mbar)\nSpecification (Full Load): 174...204 (1800...2150 mbar)
;000,6,Atmospheric,Pressure,Specification: 82...102 (900.0...1100.0 mbar)
;000,7,Coolant Temperature (G62),Specification (Warm): 80...45 (80.0...110.0 °C)
;000,8,Intake Manifold Temp. (G42),Specification (Warm): 182...50 (10.0...100.0 °C)
;000,9,Fuel Temperature (G81),Specification (Warm): 91...201 (20.0...80.0 °C)
;000,10,Mass Air Flow,Specification (Idle): 50-70 (360...480 mg/Str.\nSpecification (Full Load): 210...255 (700...850 mg/Str.)
;
;Measuring block 000 data at idle, engine warm, coolant >=80°C
;0,1-Engine Speed            ;
;0,2-Start of Injection      ;
;0,3-Trottle Position        ;0(0%)
;0,4-Injection Quantity      ;
;0,5-Manifold Absolute Press.;Not significant
;0,6-Atmospheric Pressure    ;Not significant
;0,7-Engine Coolant Temp.    ;
;0,8-Intake Manifold Temp.   ;Not significant
;0,9-Fuel Temperature        ;Not significant
;0,10-Air Mass(EGR on)       ;
;EGR is switched off after approx. 2 min. of idle (>2min, restart eng. or blip)

;Measuring block 000 data at full load, 3rd gear, temp 80°C, at 3000 rpm
;0,1-Engine Speed            ;140...180
;0,2-Start of Injection      ;>120
;0,3-Trottle Position        ;255(100%)
;0,4-Injection Quantity      ;113...127
;0,5-Manifold Absolute Press.;187..215
;0,6-Atmospheric Pressure    ;Not significant
;0,7-Engine Coolant Temp.    ;80...45
;0,8-Intake Manifold Temp.   ;Not significant
;0,9-Fuel Temperature        ;Not significant
;0,10-Air Mass               ;>185


