005,0,Start Conditions (last Engine Start)
005,1,Engine Speed,(G28),Specification (Idle): 740...840 RPM\nSpecification (Full Load): 3800...4200 RPM
005,2,Starting,Quantity
005,3,Start of,Injection (act.)
005,4,Coolant,Temperature (G62),Range: -40.5...+135.0 °C\nSpecification (Warm): 80.0...110.0 °C
;
006,0,Cruise Control System (CCS)
006,1,Vehicle Speed,(actual)
006,2,Cruise Control,Pedal Monitoring,-1--x--x = Clutch Pedal Switch operated\n-x--1--x = Brake Pedal Switch (F47) operated\n-x--x--1 = Brake Light Switch (F) operated
; -1--x--x = Clutch Pedal Switch operated
; -x--1--x = Brake Pedal Switch (F47) operated
; -x--x--1 = Brake Light Switch (F) operated
006,3,Cruise Control,Switch/Pedal,--xxxxx1 = Cruise Control ON\n--xxxx1x = Cruise Control OFF / Memory\n--xxx1xx = Decelerate (-)\n--xx1xxx = Accelerate (+)\n--x1xxxx = Brake Pedal operated\n--1xxxxx = Clutch Pedal operated
; --xxxxx1 = Cruise Control ON
; --xxxx1x = Cruise Control OFF / Memory
; --xxx1xx = Decelerate (-)
; --xx1xxx = Accelerate (+)
; --x1xxxx = Brake Pedal operated
; --1xxxxx = Clutch Pedal operated
006,4,Cruise Control,Status,0 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Function enabled and active\n1 = Cruise Control System (CCS) enabled but inactive\n2 = Accelerate (+)\n4 = Decelerate (-)\n8 = Resume\n16 = Brake Pedal operated\n32 = Maintain Cruising Speed\n255 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Function disabled
;   0 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Function enabled and active
;   1 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Function enabled but inactive
;   2 = Accelerate (+)
;   4 = Decelerate (-)
;   8 = Resume
;  16 = Brake Pedal operated
;  32 = Maintain Cruising Speed
; 255 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Function disabled
;
007,0,Temperatures
007,1,Fuel Temperature,(G81),Specification (Cold): ca. Ambient Temperature
007,2,Oil Temperatur,(G8),Specification (Cold): ca. Ambient Temperature
007,3,Intake Air,Temperature (G72),Specification (Cold): ca. Ambient Temperature
007,4,Coolant,Temperature (G62),Range: -40.5...+135.0 °C\nSpecification (Cold): ca. Ambient Temperature
;
008,0,Injection Quantity Limitation I (Torque Limitation)
008,1,Engine Speed,(G28),Specification (Idle): 740...840 RPM\nSpecification (Full Load): 3800...4200 RPM
008,2,Torque Request,(Driver),Specification (Full Load): min. 50.0 mg/Str.\n\n< 50.0 mg/Str. = Accel. Pedal not fully pressed/incorrectly adjusted
008,3,Torque Limitation,,Specification (Full Load): 42.0...47.0 mg/Str.\n\n< 42.0 mg/Str. = Engine Speed to high/los\n47.0 mg/Str. > = Injection Quantity modified (Tuning)
008,4,Smoke Limitation,,Specification (Full Load): min. 48.0 mg/Str.\n\n< 48.0 mg/Str. = Check Mass Air Flow (MAF) Sensor
;
009,0,Injection Quantity Limitation II (Torque Limitation)
009,1,Engine Speed,(G28),Specification (Idle): 740...840 RPM\nSpecification (Full Load): 3800...4200 RPM
009,2,Torque Request,(Cruise Control)
009,3,Transmission,Limitiation
009,4,Torque Restriction
;
010,0,Charge Pressure Control
010,1,Mass Air Flow,(actual),Specification (Full Load): min. 750.0 mg/Str.
010,2,Atmospheric,Pressure,Specification: 900.0...1100.0 mbar
010,3,Boost Pressure,(actual),Specification (Idle): 900.0...1100.0 mbar\nSpecification (Full Load): 1900.0...2300.0 mbar
010,4,Accel. Pedal Pos.,Sensor 1 (G79),Specification (Idle): 0.0 %\nSpecification (Full Load): 99.0...100.0 %
;
11,0,Boost pressure limitation -Full load -3rd gear - 3500rpm
11,1,Engine speed,2900-4000
11,2,Spec. intake press.,1900-2300 mbar
11,3,Actual intake press,1900-2300 mbar
