;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Engine Control Module (J248) Coding
C01,??0xx: Model
C02,00 = Audi A8 (4D)
C02,01 = Audi A6 (4B) & allroad (< MY 2004)
C03,02 = Audi A4 (8E)
C04,03 = VW Passat (3B)
C05,04 = Skoda Superb (3U)
C06,06 = Audi A6 (4B) allroad (MY 2004 >)
C07,xx0?x: Emissions
C08,0 = EURO-II
C09,1 = EURO-III
C10,xx0x?: Powertrain
C11,1 = Front-Wheel-Drive (FWD) with Automatic Transmission with/without ESP
C12,2 = Front-Wheel-Drive (FWD) with Manual Transmission with/without ESP
C13,3 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Manual Transmission without ESP
C14,4 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Automatic Transmission without ESP
C15,5 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Manual Transmission with ESP
C16,6 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Automatic Transmission with ESP
C17,7 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Continuously Variable Transmission (CVT/Multitronic/01J)
C18,8 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD) with Manual Transmission/Post-Shift-Stage
C19, 
C20,Coding for 4B0-907-401-AB / 4B0-907-401-AC / 4B0-907-401-AD as well as
C21,4D0-907-401-M / 4D0-907-401-N differs. See TPI 373601 for Details.
;
