A018,5,Maximum Speed Limiter
A018,6,The Maximum Speed Limiter Value is a one-way
A018,7,downward Adjustment. Once decreased it cannot
A018,8,be increased and you're stuck with the new Value.
A018,9, 
A018,10,Do NOT alter this Adaptation Channel unless
A018,11,you are REALLY sure what you are doing.
;
;A027,0,Adaptive Cruise Control (ACC) Start-Up Time
;65500
